F%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%90%BA%E5%B8%A6%E5%85%B6%E4%BD%9C%E4%B8%BA%E6%94%BB%E7%95%A5%E6%B9%AE%E7%81%AD%E6%B2%89%E7%81%B5BOSS%E6%97%B6%E7%9A%84%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E8%A7%82%E6%98%9F%E5%9C%A8%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E9%94%A6%E7%AD%9D%E5%8F%B9%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E6%90%BA%E5%B8%A611th%E5%8E%9F%E5%85%B8%E4%B9%9F%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%BF%98%E4%B8%8D%E9%94%99%E7%9A%84%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1635602931576\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\" contenteditable=\"false\" draggable=\"true\" data-empty-text=\"\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"role\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--role obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>适用角色</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/27/72350798/d46818f384854af0b431afd76d308565_1035754463102459212.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>神恩颂歌</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">极大增加了神恩自己的SP回复速度，同时给队友提供暴击率与少量能量回复效果的加成，</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/09/72350798/b65dc03ffcdab55a0e98f8439e5e2f13_296005977822793019.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">神恩颂歌的推荐武器，优先度较高的一把超限武器，除了有较高的暴击率提升外，神恩颂歌携带还能极大得提升sp的充能速度，不再为sp不足而头疼。记忆战场也能轻松开出大招，深渊基本也能无限循环。除神恩颂歌外。凭借其较高的面板，月下初拥也可以携带其作为攻略湮灭沉灵BOSS时的输出角色，同时观星在没有锦筝叹的情况下，携带11th原典也是一个还不错的选择</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/09/72350798/b65dc03ffcdab55a0e98f8439e5e2f13_296005977822793019.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
